{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01495","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白紵歌 · 张籍","name":"舞曲歌辞 白紵歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎皎白紵白且鲜，将作春衫称少年。\n裁缝长短不能定，自持刀尺向姑前。\n复恐兰膏污纤指，常遣傍人收堕珥。\n衣裳着时寒食下，还把玉鞭鞭白马。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}